    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "If business class and an earlier Bangkok arrival are priorities, I’d verify the January 8 Turkish award via LAX and Istanbul first. Compared with the other shown business-class award, it reports the same 275,000 points and a USD 59 SFO–LAX quote (scope unspecified), but arrives 4 hours 35 minutes earlier and has 4 hours 31 minutes less elapsed time. Award-seat support for your one traveler and award taxes are unverified, and the LAX positioning flight is on a separate booking. These are selected search results, not the full eligible inventory.",
      "label": null,
